WEBVTT

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:13.090
M4A1 is relieved after successfully
contacting M16, a member of AR Team.

00:00:13.090 --> 00:00:16.890
"A member of Griffin's AR Team"

00:00:13.090 --> 00:00:16.890
M4A1 is relieved after successfully
contacting M16, a member of AR Team.

00:00:16.890 --> 00:00:17.300
"A member of Griffin's AR Team"

00:00:16.890 --> 00:00:17.300
But immediately afterwards, M16 is
attacked by another Griffin doll.

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:23.310
But immediately afterwards, M16 is
attacked by another Griffin doll.

00:00:24.850 --> 00:00:26.860
Yes, the enemy's not that strong.

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:29.480
But they just keep coming.

00:00:29.480 --> 00:00:33.360
Oh, you were looking for
clues to their whereabouts.

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:35.410
This is the best chance I'll get.

00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:37.660
I can't miss it.

00:00:37.660 --> 00:00:41.160
Of course, I don't think
you're here to help!

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:44.910
But if you're part of Griffin and
still killing dolls that aren't Sangvis,

00:00:44.910 --> 00:00:47.790
I'd at least like to know why,

00:00:47.790 --> 00:00:48.460
416!

00:00:48.460 --> 00:00:49.340
"T-Doll affiliated with
a special Griffin squad"

00:00:48.460 --> 00:00:49.340
416!

00:00:49.340 --> 00:00:51.630
"T-Doll affiliated with
a special Griffin squad"

00:00:49.340 --> 00:00:51.630
Squad 404 has special privileges.

00:00:52.590 --> 00:00:57.430
Right now, somebody is
waiting for my return.

00:00:57.430 --> 00:00:59.890
I'm on my way out.

00:00:59.890 --> 00:01:03.020
On your way out? I don't know about that.

00:01:03.020 --> 00:01:06.600
You still have your secret
weapon on your back.

00:01:37.180 --> 00:01:38.800
Scarecrow...

00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:45.930
Executioner...

00:01:50.940 --> 00:01:52.320
Hunter...

00:01:58.660 --> 00:02:01.740
But still...

00:02:01.740 --> 00:02:04.240
...the show must go on!

00:03:36.750 --> 00:03:39.920
"13 Hours After Mission Start"

00:03:39.960 --> 00:03:43.090
"Local Time 18:00"

00:03:55.980 --> 00:03:58.400
Three on the observation deck.

00:03:59.530 --> 00:04:01.240
Six at the gate.

00:04:01.240 --> 00:04:03.740
Eighteen in the building.

00:04:03.740 --> 00:04:05.620
Not a lot.

00:04:05.620 --> 00:04:09.370
If our data is right,
this should be their base.

00:04:15.290 --> 00:04:18.590
We should be able to bust in,
if that's all there are.

00:04:18.590 --> 00:04:20.960
Share the mission plan to everyone.

00:04:20.960 --> 00:04:22.420
Already on it.

00:04:23.760 --> 00:04:27.640
Skorpion, PPSh, get your grenades ready.

00:04:27.640 --> 00:04:28.890
Okay.

00:04:28.890 --> 00:04:31.140
Draw as much attention as you can.

00:04:31.140 --> 00:04:34.230
We'll head in when the explosions go off.

00:04:37.310 --> 00:04:38.520
Now!

00:04:54.080 --> 00:04:57.750
Commander, we've destroyed
the marked point.

00:04:57.750 --> 00:04:58.920
Roger.

00:04:58.920 --> 00:05:01.500
I scanned all comms channels.

00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:05.680
The Sangvis in this area have
all been taken care of.

00:05:05.680 --> 00:05:08.510
Okay. How's the drone resupply coming?

00:05:09.800 --> 00:05:14.430
I checked. We'll have the resupply
there within 5 minutes.

00:05:16.390 --> 00:05:17.980
Kalina, what is this?

00:05:17.980 --> 00:05:19.810
Huh? That's strange.

00:05:19.810 --> 00:05:21.940
We might have picked up something.

00:05:21.940 --> 00:05:25.110
That was rather rude of you, Griffin.

00:05:26.700 --> 00:05:30.530
A public channel again?
And with background music this time.

00:05:30.530 --> 00:05:33.580
Do Sangvis Ringleaders just love drama?

00:05:33.580 --> 00:05:36.460
If you're kind enough to
pay me a visit, though,

00:05:36.460 --> 00:05:39.420
I need to give you a proper welcome.

00:05:39.420 --> 00:05:42.750
You did a fantastic job
finding my soldiers.

00:05:44.550 --> 00:05:47.680
But that's just one of
my many supply bases.

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:51.010
It means nothing to me.

00:05:51.010 --> 00:05:56.270
You couldn't even mount a proper
counterattack when my teams busted in.

00:05:56.270 --> 00:05:58.810
You're nothing special.

00:05:58.810 --> 00:06:01.360
Did I surprise you?

00:06:02.480 --> 00:06:05.740
I'm all ready to give you your welcome.

00:06:05.740 --> 00:06:08.410
So try your best...

00:06:08.410 --> 00:06:10.990
...to be entertaining.

00:06:14.200 --> 00:06:18.790
Why are all the Sangvis
bosses such bitches?

00:06:18.790 --> 00:06:21.790
I'd love to meet the person who
designed their personalities.

00:06:21.790 --> 00:06:25.170
They're weirdly human.

00:06:27.130 --> 00:06:31.090
She can't be commanding that
whole huge area on her own.

00:06:31.090 --> 00:06:34.930
And there's no way we should've
found that base so easy.

00:06:34.930 --> 00:06:37.230
She's planning something.

00:06:41.520 --> 00:06:44.320
Units 1 and 2, follow, but carefully!

00:06:44.320 --> 00:06:47.940
Roger! Unit 1 has reached the point.

00:06:47.940 --> 00:06:49.400
Heading in.

00:06:54.410 --> 00:06:56.240
It's empty...

00:06:57.910 --> 00:07:00.420
Then what we saw here was...

00:07:08.760 --> 00:07:10.340
Fake data?

00:07:10.340 --> 00:07:11.760
Master!

00:07:11.760 --> 00:07:12.970
Don't tell me...

00:07:17.180 --> 00:07:21.140
Oh my, you finally found me out.

00:07:21.140 --> 00:07:23.940
But it's far too late...

00:07:25.070 --> 00:07:27.230
...for you to escape!

00:07:31.490 --> 00:07:33.200
Shit! She set us up!

00:07:33.200 --> 00:07:35.700
Stop! We're retreating! Fall back!

00:07:36.790 --> 00:07:38.700
We need to hide somewhere!

00:07:38.700 --> 00:07:39.620
Hurry!

00:07:39.620 --> 00:07:40.830
Right!

00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:46.040
We'll fight them here!

00:07:46.040 --> 00:07:48.170
Keep an eye on your ammo!

00:07:48.170 --> 00:07:50.300
Roger!

00:07:50.300 --> 00:07:52.680
Unit 2, sitrep!

00:07:52.680 --> 00:07:54.680
We're inside the building!

00:07:54.680 --> 00:07:56.350
No damage!

00:07:56.350 --> 00:07:58.260
Check that building!

00:07:58.260 --> 00:07:59.470
Okay!

00:08:01.020 --> 00:08:03.190
Analyze the data from Unit 2!

00:08:03.190 --> 00:08:04.560
On it!

00:08:09.360 --> 00:08:12.280
One entrance...

00:08:12.280 --> 00:08:16.410
FNC and Ingram, take dummies
and head for the main gate.

00:08:16.410 --> 00:08:17.990
Roger!

00:08:17.990 --> 00:08:20.120
Ingram, no wasting ammo.

00:08:20.120 --> 00:08:21.120
Tch...

00:08:21.120 --> 00:08:24.460
Fire a smoke grenade when they rush in!

00:08:24.460 --> 00:08:27.210
Right. Right. I'll handle it.

00:08:27.210 --> 00:08:31.510
FN49 and M14, snipe the
enemy from the roof.

00:08:31.510 --> 00:08:34.880
But we can't see clearly outside.

00:08:34.880 --> 00:08:38.390
The Sangvis can't see that
far in this weather, either.

00:08:38.390 --> 00:08:39.640
Don't worry.

00:08:39.640 --> 00:08:42.890
As long as you have the high ground,
you have the advantage.

00:08:42.890 --> 00:08:45.520
Okay, understood.

00:08:45.520 --> 00:08:50.110
The enemy won't charge in immediately,
but we can't run, either.

00:08:51.320 --> 00:08:55.860
Unit 1, when you're out
of there, hurry to Unit 2.

00:08:55.860 --> 00:08:57.120
Roger.

00:08:57.120 --> 00:08:58.280
Shit...

00:08:58.280 --> 00:09:01.410
They aimed for our weakest unit.

00:09:01.410 --> 00:09:04.960
They know our forces
are limited in number.

00:09:04.960 --> 00:09:07.580
The units have to back each other up.

00:09:07.580 --> 00:09:10.590
And this probably isn't
the only fake base.

00:09:10.590 --> 00:09:13.090
They're buying all the time they need!

00:09:13.090 --> 00:09:14.340
Now, now...

00:09:14.340 --> 00:09:16.590
I'll be up all night again.

00:09:17.930 --> 00:09:21.180
Commander, I will now give
you an emergency order.

00:09:21.180 --> 00:09:25.190
The special team has found the
location of the Sangvis Ringleader.

00:09:25.190 --> 00:09:28.650
Your mission has changed
from distracting the enemy

00:09:28.650 --> 00:09:32.780
to taking down Intruder,
the Sangvis Ringleader.

00:09:32.780 --> 00:09:36.240
I've put her location and a
passable route on the map.

00:09:36.240 --> 00:09:41.120
Take her down ASAP and retake S09.

00:09:42.950 --> 00:09:45.870
Well done, special team!

00:09:45.870 --> 00:09:49.170
If we can take her down fast,
there'll be no overtime!

00:09:49.170 --> 00:09:50.920
Unit 3, change of orders!

00:09:50.920 --> 00:09:54.050
Head full speed to your new destination!

00:09:54.050 --> 00:09:55.470
Roger!

00:09:55.470 --> 00:09:57.550
Um, Commander...

00:09:57.550 --> 00:10:00.600
Isn't it dangerous to send just one unit?

00:10:00.600 --> 00:10:02.140
Don't be silly.

00:10:02.140 --> 00:10:04.680
Of course it's not just one unit.

00:10:08.560 --> 00:10:13.480
Is it really safe to ignore
the other bases?

00:10:13.480 --> 00:10:14.530
Yeah...

00:10:14.530 --> 00:10:16.780
I'll be checking my six the whole time.

00:10:16.780 --> 00:10:20.450
We could be jumped from
behind at any moment.

00:10:20.450 --> 00:10:23.660
I believe in my commander's decisions.

00:10:23.660 --> 00:10:27.460
But this is dangerous.

00:10:29.250 --> 00:10:31.670
We have but one goal!

00:10:36.010 --> 00:10:39.220
To win victory with all our body and soul!

00:10:44.390 --> 00:10:45.680
Let's go!

00:10:52.110 --> 00:10:56.440
AR15, share our location
to the other units!

00:10:56.440 --> 00:11:00.490
PPSh-41, Skorpion,
we'll disrupt their formation.

00:11:12.790 --> 00:11:14.000
Dummies destroyed!

00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:16.300
Multiple enemy contacts!
Continuing the operation!

00:11:16.300 --> 00:11:19.170
Keep firing! We'll pick up the ammo later!

00:11:34.650 --> 00:11:37.440
Sangvis communications are concentrated
in the building to our front.

00:11:37.440 --> 00:11:38.650
We're going in!

00:11:51.790 --> 00:11:53.790
Where's the Sangvis Ringleader?

00:12:11.270 --> 00:12:12.980
Splendid!

00:12:12.980 --> 00:12:17.150
I didn't think you'd find me this fast.

00:12:17.150 --> 00:12:18.820
Intruder...

00:12:23.360 --> 00:12:27.490
Intruder, tell me! Where is M16?

00:12:30.200 --> 00:12:36.500
M4A1, the Griffin doll that
defeated Executioner.

00:12:36.500 --> 00:12:41.590
AR15, the Griffin doll
that defeated Hunter.

00:12:43.010 --> 00:12:48.760
Why do I have to tell you, my enemies,
such valuable information?

00:12:51.730 --> 00:12:56.560
If I answered with that, wouldn't it
make things more dramatic?

00:12:58.570 --> 00:13:01.150
But I don't know anything.

00:13:01.150 --> 00:13:02.780
And I don't care.

00:13:02.780 --> 00:13:04.820
It's not part of my mission.

00:13:04.820 --> 00:13:06.660
You...

00:13:06.660 --> 00:13:11.240
Don't tell me that just because you found
one of your companions at Hunter's base,

00:13:11.240 --> 00:13:14.330
you think the other is with me?

00:13:17.210 --> 00:13:19.960
I appreciate that you're making
the show more exciting,

00:13:19.960 --> 00:13:22.880
but it's time for you to exit stage left.

00:13:22.880 --> 00:13:24.630
Don't get cocky!

00:13:24.630 --> 00:13:26.130
We defeated all your dolls.

00:13:26.130 --> 00:13:28.260
You're all that's left!

00:13:28.260 --> 00:13:34.890
Oh... I suppose I should introduce myself.

00:13:34.890 --> 00:13:42.110
I'm the Sangvis Command-type Doll
over Scarecrow, Executioner, and Hunter.

00:13:42.110 --> 00:13:46.450
Manufacturer Number SP914, Intruder.

00:13:48.820 --> 00:13:53.580
As a command-type, I'm going
to win this fight with strategy!

00:13:55.290 --> 00:13:59.330
Units 1 and 2 are in
combat with the Sangvis!

00:13:59.330 --> 00:14:03.340
I've sent plenty of troops
after your companions.

00:14:03.340 --> 00:14:05.970
Don't expect reinforcements.

00:14:05.970 --> 00:14:10.260
And Griffin's elite dolls, the AR Team...

00:14:10.260 --> 00:14:13.180
I won't underestimate you.

00:14:13.180 --> 00:14:19.060
You're at least ten times stronger
than the civilian dolls next to you.

00:14:19.060 --> 00:14:23.360
So I need to use an appropriate
amount of my strength against you.

00:14:23.360 --> 00:14:25.490
I wouldn't want to be rude.

00:14:32.240 --> 00:14:33.120
An ambush?

00:14:33.120 --> 00:14:36.080
There's a lot! Th-This many?

00:14:36.080 --> 00:14:40.250
Now, show me what you can do!

00:14:41.500 --> 00:14:43.380
Let the show begin!

00:14:57.890 --> 00:14:59.100
Get down!

00:15:10.450 --> 00:15:12.950
We can't move like this!

00:15:12.950 --> 00:15:18.580
A concert hall is built so that the voices
from the stage reach every seat!

00:15:18.580 --> 00:15:21.620
I used that to my advantage
when placing the guns.

00:15:21.620 --> 00:15:24.090
There's nowhere to run.

00:15:25.170 --> 00:15:26.550
Scarecrow!

00:15:27.800 --> 00:15:29.550
Executioner!

00:15:29.880 --> 00:15:31.300
Hunter!

00:15:31.300 --> 00:15:32.840
Behold!

00:15:32.840 --> 00:15:35.850
The futile, pathetic struggles of Griffin!

00:15:35.850 --> 00:15:38.310
She'll hear anything we say on comms.

00:15:38.310 --> 00:15:40.980
And I can't hear any voices in this noise!

00:15:40.980 --> 00:15:42.770
And more than anything...

00:15:42.770 --> 00:15:44.480
...we can't move!

00:15:53.570 --> 00:15:55.280
Did you shoot that?

00:15:59.660 --> 00:16:01.830
There's someone else?

00:16:06.840 --> 00:16:09.920
A blind spot... There's a route?

00:16:12.880 --> 00:16:15.180
M4! Your orders!

00:16:15.180 --> 00:16:17.850
Useless, useless, useless. Useless!

00:16:17.850 --> 00:16:21.690
You're going to sing your requiem here!

00:16:23.770 --> 00:16:25.270
M4!

00:16:25.270 --> 00:16:26.480
Huh?

00:16:37.490 --> 00:16:39.240
What's this?

00:16:39.240 --> 00:16:41.960
There's a blind spot! Move, everyone!

00:16:41.960 --> 00:16:44.460
Yes!

00:16:44.460 --> 00:16:46.210
Why?

00:16:46.210 --> 00:16:49.000
A breakdown? Impossible!

00:16:50.130 --> 00:16:52.470
Surrounding troops, head in!

00:17:01.270 --> 00:17:03.310
Too weak!

00:17:07.020 --> 00:17:10.690
How does it feel to use vision sync?

00:17:10.690 --> 00:17:14.400
Wonderful! I can see just
where the enemy is!

00:17:16.070 --> 00:17:19.780
Then let this assassins' party begin!

00:17:32.050 --> 00:17:35.880
They can't be firing that
accurately in this darkness!

00:17:43.270 --> 00:17:47.770
They have a dedicated observer
dummy acting as a relay?

00:17:47.770 --> 00:17:50.610
When did it get up there?

00:17:50.610 --> 00:17:52.940
Don't tell me...

00:17:52.940 --> 00:17:55.700
You were the dolls?

00:18:07.500 --> 00:18:10.920
I suppose it's time for the finale, then.

00:18:16.260 --> 00:18:20.050
Who'll be left standing
for the curtain call?

00:18:20.050 --> 00:18:22.560
Don't worry.

00:18:22.560 --> 00:18:27.020
I always close out the show personally!

00:18:33.020 --> 00:18:34.690
Scarecrow...

00:18:35.900 --> 00:18:37.780
Executioner...

00:18:39.240 --> 00:18:40.780
Hunter...

00:18:41.950 --> 00:18:45.910
Can you hear my song?

00:18:49.420 --> 00:18:50.830
Deploy to the left and right!

00:18:50.830 --> 00:18:52.500
Create a blind spot!

00:18:57.340 --> 00:19:00.640
That caliber at this range is useless!

00:19:06.980 --> 00:19:09.600
Now, time for the final act.

00:19:11.940 --> 00:19:15.320
Sorry. It's my job to
bring down the house.

00:19:27.370 --> 00:19:29.080
Big Sis M16!

00:19:29.080 --> 00:19:30.460
Stay sharp!

00:19:35.590 --> 00:19:37.260
Target down.

00:19:38.630 --> 00:19:42.930
I guess that's all you can expect
from a Sangvis "strategy."

00:19:42.930 --> 00:19:48.430
Jeez... you used Unit 3 to lure
out the Sangvis main force.

00:19:48.430 --> 00:19:50.060
That was way too risky!

00:19:50.060 --> 00:19:55.610
But, well... someone else
ended up stealing the show.

00:19:55.610 --> 00:19:57.280
My, my...

00:19:57.280 --> 00:20:02.070
I suppose I should've known
I couldn't beat human cunning.

00:20:03.200 --> 00:20:06.910
No struggling at the
end for you, Intruder?

00:20:06.910 --> 00:20:10.830
Everything's following the script.

00:20:10.830 --> 00:20:15.670
My own story ending differently
doesn't bother me.

00:20:15.670 --> 00:20:18.760
The one thing I regret is that

00:20:18.760 --> 00:20:24.640
I couldn't give them a
wonderful finale in this body.

00:20:25.850 --> 00:20:30.310
The fun's over so quickly, isn't it?

00:20:30.310 --> 00:20:34.650
This ending was fun for you?

00:20:34.650 --> 00:20:38.730
It's all in how you look at things, M4A1.

00:20:38.730 --> 00:20:43.410
Just like you, I was just
a player on the stage,

00:20:43.410 --> 00:20:47.330
killing time with my playing.

00:20:47.330 --> 00:20:50.410
And now my role is over.

00:20:50.410 --> 00:20:53.830
So how could it not be fun?

00:20:55.080 --> 00:20:59.170
For now, this is enough.

00:20:59.170 --> 00:21:03.720
The real show is about to begin.

00:21:03.720 --> 00:21:05.390
The real show?

00:21:08.050 --> 00:21:13.810
A story's more fun if it leaves a
little mystery lingering in its wake.

00:21:17.020 --> 00:21:19.860
Target has shut down.

00:21:19.860 --> 00:21:21.570
Understood.

00:21:21.570 --> 00:21:23.400
Mission complete.

00:21:23.400 --> 00:21:24.700
Roger.

00:21:26.360 --> 00:21:28.450
It's over, huh?

00:21:32.500 --> 00:21:33.710
--M16.
--Hm?

00:21:33.710 --> 00:21:36.710
Huh? This is M16?

00:21:36.710 --> 00:21:38.210
Nice to meet you.

00:21:38.210 --> 00:21:41.920
How were you hiding without any
of us being able to see you?

00:21:41.920 --> 00:21:46.380
Hey, I'm the one who found
the Sangvis Ringleader.

00:21:46.380 --> 00:21:49.390
I wasn't slacking off.

00:21:49.390 --> 00:21:52.220
Why didn't you link up with us before?

00:21:52.220 --> 00:21:57.190
Because, well... she was being pretty
careful about protecting herself.

00:21:57.190 --> 00:22:00.570
I knew you'd figure it out.

00:22:00.570 --> 00:22:04.400
M16! You're back!

00:22:04.400 --> 00:22:05.360
Yeah.

00:22:05.360 --> 00:22:07.530
Now everybody's together, huh?

00:22:07.530 --> 00:22:10.370
It's great to have comrades, huh?

00:22:11.830 --> 00:22:13.370
M4...

00:22:18.710 --> 00:22:21.250
Ow! What was that for?

00:22:21.250 --> 00:22:23.130
I'm already in bad shape!

00:22:23.130 --> 00:22:25.670
What if that killed me?

00:22:25.670 --> 00:22:27.470
Then die!

00:22:27.470 --> 00:22:30.550
I don't even want to reinstall
your backup data!

00:22:30.550 --> 00:22:32.390
I'll melt you down myself!

00:22:32.390 --> 00:22:35.020
And reset your memory myself!

00:22:36.180 --> 00:22:39.230
Do you know how much I worried about you?

00:22:39.230 --> 00:22:40.860
Knock it off.

00:22:40.860 --> 00:22:43.270
I'm finally home.

00:22:43.270 --> 00:22:46.900
You could at least show me a smile.

00:22:51.450 --> 00:22:52.910
Right, right.

